<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-11T22:53:08.679Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:53:08 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran-backed suspects have been accused of plotting attacks on a U.K. base that hosts U.S. jets and of a drone strike on the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan, which halted production and cut power. Iraqi security officials linked the Khor Mor attack to internal disputes and announced new details about the incident, while a security chief disclosed plans to expand air-defence deployments. Iraqi authorities arrested a suspect accused of killing his brother in Shamamak and a delegation is being sent to Lebanon after the body of former MP Ahmed al-Alwani was found there. The conflict has resulted in 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFB6ZEFrRTFCdzBsUHhxSGVwZlAwNHhkX3hKZjZEWjdqNE5DMWJvZmdRNXpORHlxYmlkOUZXVnhkSzlyYkg3dVIwWHZiMzFxTDBpYkJUejlYSTZRUWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE5odkd1bGZOWGdpeXpQNlNHcWhfR3NTem9XcURWQnRIbHFBQ3paSzd1U0dhWWFxVG92UkxGX0ZpY0J5Z1dYSW13UUJRVkRXZGROUEhnWTFQT2Qwajd5c3dUWE95VW9VbWR4dVlkSVpscFVheDRtVkRNZS1tSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPNTQ1cXB1RllzcFRJaTlMYXNUc1liZkVPSk9Fc2RPNGE5bkJYY0ExdDB4cWs2bURKcHBFMFEwa3BDNDZVSTdYVDNrWGZsREwzZTVJWmZ6N3ExQlNxdnJfT0R5UjdaNHZmQ3FFZWxtbTRGTHk3dFRzbWxnY2VGMlFtQ1puN2tBZEh6eDZMaEFWWjVQRHVXeXYwQ0c5bTJfSjhUeDh1aGxlNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE1DSlB6ZkR0SThpcXJzZGV3OGxseXNSM0E1LUFDZ1UyUjV3NTRxSE5zV0ZXbkp0M0VnLVR2dFRzQjJDUUF4dXQ1X29PeEhCWjRfRE0zbnlWUDRXYWcxekxCV1BQSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQQzBGT0hkNWp6XzBsVFUw